NOTE: other parts of Mindboggle-101 are published under different terms. The
OASIS-TRT-20 whole-brain (subcortical) labels are CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 and are
published as a separate record. The original source magnetic resonance images
for the 101 brains are not included in this record; they remain subject to the
data use agreements of the projects that released them (including OASIS, NKI
and the Multi-Modal Reproducibility Resource).
